{"id":"00787d1ad50fa75c","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-real-closed.md","title":"Real Closed","display":"df-real-closed — Real Closed","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-real-closed","aliases":["58-df-real-closed"],"display":"df-real-closed — Real Closed","depends_on":["[[58-df-field]]","[[58-df-polynomial]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-real-closed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-real-closed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-real-closed — Real Closed"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" href=\"?note=ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" title=\"58-df-polynomial\">58-df-polynomial</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,&lt;)\">\\((F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,&lt;)\\)</span> (ordered-field candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\\)</span> (field predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderedField}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,&lt;)\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderedField}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,&lt;)\\)</span> (ordered-field predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> (ring-explicit polynomial relations, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" href=\"?note=ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" title=\"58-df-polynomial\">58-df-polynomial</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle r\\rangle\\in F^1\">\\(\\langle r\\rangle\\in F^1\\)</span> is the one-coordinate point with value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealClosed}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{RealClosed}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (real-closed predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}field}\\vdash \\mathrm{OrderedField}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,&lt;)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\\land &lt;\\;\\subseteq F\\times F\\land\\forall a\\in F\\;\\neg(a&lt;a)\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in F\\;((a&lt;b\\land b&lt;c)\\to a&lt;c)\\land\\forall a,b\\in F\\;(a&lt;b\\lor a=b\\lor b&lt;a)\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in F\\;(a&lt;b\\to a+c&lt;b+c)\\land\\forall a,b\\in F\\;((0_F&lt;a\\land0_F&lt;b)\\to0_F&lt;a\\cdot b)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}field}\\vdash \\mathrm{OrderedField}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,&lt;)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\\land &lt;\\;\\subseteq F\\times F\\land\\forall a\\in F\\;\\neg(a&lt;a)\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in F\\;((a&lt;b\\land b&lt;c)\\to a&lt;c)\\land\\forall a,b\\in F\\;(a&lt;b\\lor a=b\\lor b&lt;a)\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in F\\;(a&lt;b\\to a+c&lt;b+c)\\land\\forall a,b\\in F\\;((0_F&lt;a\\land0_F&lt;b)\\to0_F&lt;a\\cdot b)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}closed}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealClosed}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,&lt;)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{OrderedField}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,&lt;)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in F\\;\\bigl(0_F&lt;a\\to\\exists b\\in F\\;(b\\cdot b=a)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p,d\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d,p,F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{66pt}\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;(d=2m+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38pt}\\to\\exists r\\in F\\;\n\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S(0_F,p,\\langle r\\rangle,F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,1)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}closed}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealClosed}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,&lt;)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{OrderedField}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,&lt;)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in F\\;\\bigl(0_F&lt;a\\to\\exists b\\in F\\;(b\\cdot b=a)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p,d\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d,p,F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{66pt}\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;(d=2m+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38pt}\\to\\exists r\\in F\\;\n\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S(0_F,p,\\langle r\\rangle,F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,1)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Real closed fields have algebraic closure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(i)\">\\(F(i)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The odd-degree clause uses the ring-explicit degree and evaluation relations.  In the finite-support encoding, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(\\langle i\\rangle)\">\\(p(\\langle i\\rangle)\\)</span> is the coefficient of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^i\">\\(X^i\\)</span>; it is not the value of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>.  Hence the root clause must use <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-polynomial]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)$ (field predicate, see [[58-df-field]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^8$ and $\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^9$ (ring-explicit polynomial relations, see [[58-df-polynomial]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,<)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderedField}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,<)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^9","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle r\\rangle\\in F^1","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealClosed}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}field}\\vdash \\mathrm{OrderedField}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,<)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\\land <\\;\\subseteq F\\times F\\land\\forall a\\in F\\;\\neg(a<a)\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in F\\;((a<b\\land b<c)\\to a<c)\\land\\forall a,b\\in F\\;(a<b\\lor a=b\\lor b<a)\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in F\\;(a<b\\to a+c<b+c)\\land\\forall a,b\\in F\\;((0_F<a\\land0_F<b)\\to0_F<a\\cdot b)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}closed}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealClosed}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,<)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{OrderedField}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,<)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in F\\;\\bigl(0_F<a\\to\\exists b\\in F\\;(b\\cdot b=a)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p,d\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d,p,F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,1)\\\\\n&\\hspace{66pt}\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;(d=2m+1)\\\\\n&\\hspace{38pt}\\to\\exists r\\in F\\;\n\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S(0_F,p,\\langle r\\rangle,F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F,1)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"F(i)","display":false},{"tex":"p(\\langle i\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"X^i","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S","display":false}],"bytes":2056,"backlinks":[{"id":"ec2932ad627d4692","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OrderedField}_S$ is the ordered-field predicate from [[../batch15/58-df-real-closed.md]]."},{"id":"c36cc156fef49a61","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OrderedField}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R})$ is imported from [[58-df-real-closed]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1043","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-real-closed.md|58-df-real-closed]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["1eb4a89b005d9cda","ab5e359a8ea0dcb4"]}